                    "text": [
                      "Slush checks the\nline with his own\nruler. The second\ndoor does not\nremove his wheel.",
                      "It prevents his\nwheel from being\nthe only door. He\nasks Dot to\nexplain what fails",
                      "if the bypass\nfreezes too."
